Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,用罗马人的血把他妈的雪地染红\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall see roman blood upon fucking snow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会带着他们去送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not march my people to the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.13,0:00:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也绝不会让罗马狗从背后捅刀子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will not die with a roman sword in my back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告过你 远离我这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have warned you to stay far from men of my kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经历了痛苦和失去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have known pain and loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们当中的很多人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A misfortune shared by many among us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时你听提比略命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall to command beneath Tiberius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么要剑都拿不稳的小子担此大任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a boy prone to losing his sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧 你又该卑躬屈膝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we stand, you beneath heel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.49,0:00:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要留在希留爱沙 - 就在这座宅子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am to remain in Sinuessa? - In this very villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 服侍提比略 - 我知道他很看重你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Beneath Tiberius. - I know how much he cares for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.15,0:00:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她非常急切地要与你父亲谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was desperate to break word with your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有何事如此急迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}What concerns so move her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是他们的秘密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that is the mystery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.45,0:00:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的奴隶送回希留爱沙了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was my slave escorted back to Sinuessa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跑到叛贼的队伍里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has moved to join the rebellion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛贼突破了围墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rebels have breached the wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的克拉苏在我们面前屁滚尿流地跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mighty Crassus flees from us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.11,0:00:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:04.58,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：诅咒者之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:11.08,Title,0,0,0,0,,《分道扬镳》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.45,0:01:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马人又从后方打过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romans set again upon rear position!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.58,0:02:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马今天就派这么点人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all Rome has to offer this day?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.48,0:03:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没杀够呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not yet had my fill of blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.59,0:03:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏一天之内就进攻了两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus lays assault twice upon a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可每次兵力都不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet with but a handful of men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.00,0:03:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要拖慢我们的脚步 好让大军追上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seeks but time for his legions to narrow gap between us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我们要保护老弱病残 必然放慢脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing we will slow to protect those weakest among us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一招他是用定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A strategy taking firmest hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你的神 我克雷斯鄙视他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your gods that Crixus pisses upon them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.40,0:03:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁这家伙还活着 我要问他点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would break words while he is yet of this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.02,0:03:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏还有几天时间赶上我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many days march does Crassus find himself to our backs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃屎去吧 该死的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stroke cock, you fucking slave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.23,0:03:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他配合一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}See his tongue made more agreeable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,四天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four days!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,四天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four days!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.67,0:03:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,四天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿好武器 继续行进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather weapons, and rejoin march.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回答了你的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave what was asked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 留我一条命吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg of you, spare my life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.95,0:03:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你求错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You beg the wrong man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据腐烂程度和气味 已经死了三天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone to grass three days past, by rot and stench.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离斯巴达克斯又近了一天的路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gained another day on Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.11,0:04:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停下 - 这有什么奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Halt! - Is it a wonder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,从米利亚峰一路过来 我们几乎没休息过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men have barely rested since Melia Ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚也不能休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor will they find such this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,命令第二军团停止休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give command to second legion to fall from rest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必等全体集合 即刻开始追击\N{\fnArial\fs30}and continue pursuit in advance of fullest number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.75,0:04:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你催得太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You push them too hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是心慈手软的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is not the time for gentle words nor soft intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.81,0:04:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为了将来的战事着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I harden towards future conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,处在崩溃边缘的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet a legion on the brink of collapse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.19,0:04:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么对抗斯巴达克斯和他的队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}is ill thought towards Spartacus and his army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟不上行进速度的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any within ranks unable to keep pace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.53,0:04:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接原地处死\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall be struck down where they stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,十一抽杀律难道还不够…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was decimation not threat enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.97,0:04:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不能让他从我手心里溜走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not let him slip from fucking grasp!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,统帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.65,0:05:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅泰勒斯元老求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Metellus demands audience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.79,0:05:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅泰勒斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metellus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我去罗马传达消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dispatch me to Rome to crow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,说斯巴达克斯必败于米利亚峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the inevitable fall of Spartacus upon Melia Ridge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.09,0:05:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果让我丢尽了脸面\N{\fnArial\fs30}only to have recent news brand me overreaching fool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你说话的腔调\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find your tone displeasing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢打败了仗所造成的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I find of many things swirling about failed campaign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.01,0:05:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯只是延迟了死期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus but prolongs his end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.16,0:05:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,回罗马传信吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to Rome and deliver message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是共和国的元老\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a Senator of the Republic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你他妈的信使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not fucking message boy to deliver{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,传达连影子都看不到的捷报\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet more tidings of imagined victories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.42,0:05:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你是你就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand what I deem necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.94,0:05:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你忘了我们的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or has our arrangement slipped from mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的希留爱沙宅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep promise of villa in Sinuessa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的花不完的税金\N{\fnArial\fs30}and purse lined with the coin of taxes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.89,0:05:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟克拉苏的名号搅在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Association with the name of Crassus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会玷污我自己的名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}will only serve to further taint my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.35,0:05:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都不会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing has fallen to change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.98,0:05:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会彻底剿灭斯巴达克斯及其走狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall grind Spartacus and his rebellion beneath heel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我承诺的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I have promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺有志气的嘛 据说你最心爱的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lofty words coming from a man whose most trusted slave{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:06:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑去投靠了叛贼头子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}is said to have fled to join the rebel king{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.14,0:06:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别掺和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay from argument.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.67,0:06:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have lost fucking mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟敢对我动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will see the Senate cast you out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.12,0:06:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,元老院必定将你扫地出门…\N{\fnArial\fs30}for laying hands upon honored member{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.97,0:06:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.59,0:06:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}will do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,按我\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.73,0:06:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,命令的\N{\fnArial\fs30}fucking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}command!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,回罗马去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.93,0:06:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢提这件事 敢说我一句坏话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak of this, or any word against me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.31,0:06:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是倾家荡产 也要找个晚上做了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I shall devote fortune towards your death in darkness of night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.37,0:06:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,送他上马\N{\fnArial\fs30}See him upon his horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.24,0:06:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二军团即刻追击斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And second legion set to purpose towards Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.37,0:06:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,传令下去 全军待命 准备转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give word to stand ready to move upon a moment's notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.13,0:06:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可因一时安逸而掉以轻心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must not fall to sense of comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想学那惊弓之鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not favor fleeing like rabbits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人没来就四处逃窜\N{\fnArial\fs30}at imagined footfall of hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们在重整兵力之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet we must stay in advance of Crassus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还是得避开克拉苏的锋芒 - 很明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}- until numbers are replenished. - A wise path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我更喜欢把罗马军杀个片甲不留\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though one paved with Roman heads fucking preferred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们大意了 片甲不留的只会是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall find our own upon it, if we fall from caution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是第一次听你说这种话\N{\fnArial\fs30}A word once unfamiliar upon your tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是替那些老弱病残着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoken now with thought towards those less able among us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们和战士消耗的粮食同样多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet they devour as much as any man of sword or spear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not wrong in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.70,0:07:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,粮草将尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supplies are nearly spent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快又要饿着肚子 举步维艰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon hunger will again be upon us, weighing each step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,派卢戈他们去前方侦察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather Lugo and scout ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看有什么机会能抢些粮草回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would know of any opportunity towards grain or meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.77,0:07:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能永远避开他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot run for an eternity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.75,0:07:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们迟早要跟他们决一死战\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day soon we will once again have to stand and fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他这么做是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he holds right in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争时期 没有什么是确定无疑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No ground held is certain, in times of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.54,0:08:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次从克拉苏的血口中逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}To slip from jaws of Crassus yet again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你落入虎口的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not see you caught between them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.27,0:08:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收集来的柴火挺多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been overreaching in my efforts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.38,0:08:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起生火吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and would share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.81,0:08:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你也同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are of a mind…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.18,0:08:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,生火吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See fire to life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了我盯着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And know my eyes are upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看我的眼神里还是有敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}His stare yet holds the promise of violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.04,0:08:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就继续杀罗马人 证明你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue to prove yourself against the Romans, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.86,0:08:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,化敌为友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see it soften.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他完全不用在这方面担心什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man need not fall to worry in such regard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.07,0:08:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过说到我心中所属\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet in matters nearer the heart, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他倒是有必要担忧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}his concerns are well founded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.03,0:08:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再想这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rid yourself of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.54,0:08:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不要再说这种话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And break no more upon subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你毫不在乎 一笑而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you had laughed carelessly at my words, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那便是我自作多情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have known feelings misplaced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:08:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你极力掩饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you froth and foam, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,反倒说明你有所心动\N{\fnArial\fs30}showing they strike reflective chord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.18,0:09:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自己会错意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mistake reflection for your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.65,0:09:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走过时发现你偷看我 莫非也是我弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do I mistake your eyes stealing glance as I pass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.52,0:09:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我走近时 你那么急促的呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or breath from lips catching when I draw near?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕要露天席地而睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had feared night spent beneath open sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.51,0:09:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.77,0:09:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不算什么 - 不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A thing of little note. - Little?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把快乐建立在我的痛苦之上可没过多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was but short time past you would have found joy in my suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别以为我已经忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not think me so far removed from thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.33,0:09:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么要帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why offer hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在帮斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offer it towards Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是搞不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It baffles fucking sense, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.56,0:09:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他似乎对你有些着迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet he appears to carry affection towards you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我不知道说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I've have not the words{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.93,0:09:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor I desire to hear them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.62,0:09:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯这辈子牺牲得够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus has sacrificed much in this life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该享受一点点快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}He deserves some small measure of happiness in return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.64,0:09:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人也是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}As so many are owed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.91,0:10:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am in need of aid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.14,0:10:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must bear down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.29,0:10:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,用尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}As hard as you are able.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再来 - 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Again. - I cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.25,0:10:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,按她说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do as instructed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.41,0:10:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,携雨之使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bringer of Rain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.13,0:10:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想活下去 就用力生下来 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wish to live, bear down. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我把刀子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blade. Quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜得贵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are blessed with a son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.79,0:10:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这孩子的小弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the cock on this one, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.49,0:10:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,晃来晃去的多威风\N{\fnArial\fs30}dangling as if from Jupiter himself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:10:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿他懂得尊重别人的意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray he uses it only upon the willing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.35,0:11:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真是幸运 有这么熟练的双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is fortunate to have such skilled hands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他来到世间\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring him into this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.40,0:11:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前也接生过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have done this before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,做过很多次 给我主人的女奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many times, for those owned by my dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道我是否认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if I might have known of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What name did he carry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pompo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.60,0:11:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,坎帕尼亚附近的一个畜牧主\N{\fnArial\fs30}A raiser of low animals near Campania{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说庞波\N{\fnArial\fs30}She speaks of Pompo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但手上的印记却显示另有其主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet mark upon her arm tells of a different master…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.95,0:11:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是马科斯•克拉苏的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were slave to Marcus Crassus himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.12,0:11:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.97,0:11:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来一个卧底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another spy, sent to infiltrate rank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么卧底愿意暴露身份给孩子接生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What manner of spy pauses in deceit to give aid in child's birth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.23,0:11:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙派卧底来就是要我们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}One sent by the man trying to end our fucking lives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.56,0:11:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他并没有派我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did not send me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是从他在米利亚峰的大帐里逃出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fled his tent upon the Melia Ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何要背叛他 莫非喜欢这严寒暴雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you turn from him, in favor of cold and storm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.57,0:11:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.61,0:11:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然以后休想还能说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or find yourself forever unable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.61,0:11:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这姑娘和你们很多人一样 都是逃亡至此\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl is fugitivus as many among you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管她是从哪个主人那里逃出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}regardless of which dominus she fled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}She deserves protection, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:11:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是半遮半掩的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}not veiled threats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:12:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不半遮半掩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hide behind no veils.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,带有敌人印记的人也不能隐瞒不答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor shall any bearing mark of my enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.21,0:12:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏待我不薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus himself has seen no harm to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.45,0:12:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他儿子深深地伤害了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet name of honored son inflicted grievous injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还不肯善罢干休\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would have continued to do so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子也有过这般遭遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife stood equally mistreated, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是拜她所谓的主人所赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}by those that called themselves her masters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来照看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's your responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,给她吃喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}See her provided for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.72,0:12:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她所说有半句虚言\N{\fnArial\fs30}And know if her tale falls from truth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的死期也就不远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then her life shall swiftly follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有顾虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hold concern in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱塔说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laeta breaks truth in the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.39,0:13:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能拒绝任何渴望自由的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot turn from any slave wishing freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她自由了 终于可以和我们一起挨饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let her be free to starve with the rest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.66,0:13:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚睡前把一切准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}See all readied before you take sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.41,0:13:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天一亮我们就跟上第二军团出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We follow second legion at first light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.71,0:13:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像没有叫你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not recall commanding your presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.73,0:13:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近的事容不得我不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recent events spur initiative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall from sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.78,0:13:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am of a concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Towards your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.71,0:13:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the lay of your thoughts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.20,0:13:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fitful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.45,0:13:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从米利亚峰进展不顺 他就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}His manner since Melia Ridge has been…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:13:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}unsettling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个铁腕领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}He but commands with firm hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.53,0:14:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛揍自己的盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clenched into fist striking ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅泰勒斯口不择言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metellus spoke out of turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.23,0:14:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他是个不折不扣的蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a fool, you will find no argument.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.09,0:14:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但同时还是共和国元老院的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet one that stands a fucking Senator of the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.32,0:14:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As does my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.11,0:14:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他的反应已经失去了理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose reply far outweighed balance of insult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他一向对自控能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially for a man who prides himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}on appearance of control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.11,0:14:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在打仗 提比略\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are at war, Tiberius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.37,0:14:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕只有一点点失策\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against an enemy that will exploit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人摸到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}even the slightest weakness, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,必然要我们万劫不复\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bring us all to our doom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.99,0:14:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有话直说 不要拐弯抹角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tread path of more direct route, and arrive at point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再次获得了你父亲的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beloved son has regained favor of his father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.34,0:14:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你嘴里提出的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Measured counsel spilling from your mouth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.69,0:14:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许能让他恢复理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}may yet again fill him with reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.35,0:14:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,驱散克芮的背叛带给他的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And dispel troubled thought of Kore escaping{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的是为了你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fucking cock between your legs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.14,0:14:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,才来这里的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why you have come to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.69,0:14:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要平息他的怒火\N{\fnArial\fs30}To calm storm of his wrath before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.31,0:14:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免扫地出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are swept away in downpour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mistake intent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.97,0:14:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道不是你违抗命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you not the one who defied command{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,带克芮去米利亚峰的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to spirit Kore to Melia Ridge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.43,0:15:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为她的背叛大开方便之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giving her opportunity to betray him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.87,0:15:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是流着泪来求我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She pleaded with tears upon cheek, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.43,0:15:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,要跟你父亲谈谈他的混蛋儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}to break words with your father about his fucking son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.87,0:15:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,略施小计\N{\fnArial\fs30}A simple ruse, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.64,0:15:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为她逃离米利亚峰 投靠叛贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}one imagined to make escape upon Melia Ridge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个借口而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}to join the rebels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.93,0:15:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信其中确有把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh I believe there to be ruse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是深受宠爱的奴隶所玩的把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet not one formed by mind of loving slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.64,0:15:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对她干了什么 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to her, boy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.56,0:15:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼她逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make her flee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.92,0:15:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是用你那发育不全的小弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you force that tiny cock inside her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.89,0:15:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太过分了 护民官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking overstep, Tribune!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每天都冒犯你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many times each day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.06,0:15:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这件事 你我都知道是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet in this, we both know I do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.71,0:15:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我揭露了你的兽行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will uncover the truth of what you have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲便能恢复理智了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your father will fall again to reason…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.31,0:15:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道背叛他的人并不是克芮\N{\fnArial\fs30}when wounded heart is balmed by knowledge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.99,0:16:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对他受伤的心是多么安慰啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Kore is not the one who has betrayed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.20,0:16:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子降临在如此残酷的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}The child is born into a life of piss and shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.03,0:16:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是自由的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.77,0:16:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As so many among us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.00,0:16:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 我也有了自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I stand now, because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你得到的不仅仅是自由两个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you blessed with more than just a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.55,0:16:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有锦衣玉食\N{\fnArial\fs30}An endless bounty of food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.65,0:16:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个为你遮风挡雨的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a proper home to keep you warm on coldest night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许还能养育一个我们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps even a child of our own upon a day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.23,0:17:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在没有能力给你这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I have not had the strength to provide you with any of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把我从矿场中解救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your strength saw me from the mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.38,0:17:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,指引我走出黑暗 重新找回自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guided me from the shadows, returning life to faded shell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,却给了你血肉横飞 刀光剑影的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}A life stained with blood and battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我自己的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}My path has been chosen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.28,0:17:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是命运的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not by the fates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是神灵的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not by the gods themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.41,0:17:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择了站在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I choose to walk by your side, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论今生还是来世\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this life and the one that follows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们走到生命尽头之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we find ourselves upon its shores…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.43,0:17:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望多杀几个罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I desire only to send more fucking Romans there before us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你是我莫大的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not deserve a woman such as you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.10,0:17:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是只属于你一个人的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the only man who truly does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.73,0:18:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯和卢戈回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus and Lugo return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯有话要跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus would have words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.18,0:18:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在一处山谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have laid eyes upon a valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了二十多座宅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty or more villas nestled within.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有数不清的牛羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bounty of cattle and goat grazing lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let us fall upon them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.04,0:18:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让罗马人和牲畜的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see the blood of beasts and Romans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.85,0:18:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,与今晚的月色交相辉映\N{\fnArial\fs30}mingle beneath night's moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,破晓之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And upon dawn's break, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将拔营北进\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would press north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.12,0:18:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,向阿尔卑斯山进军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Towards rise of the Alps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想在山上安营扎寨吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would set up camp upon the mountains?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.72,0:18:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要越过山脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would cross them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.08,0:18:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在山的那一边 让我们的人四散而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And upon other side, see our people to the winds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:19:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这回是疯彻底了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he at last gone fucking mad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是一支大军 克拉苏很容易追上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus pursues a single army, easily tracked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.07,0:19:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可要是成千上万个奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands of slaves running free{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.46,0:19:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在共和国的疆域外自由来去\N{\fnArial\fs30}beyond lands of the Republic…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.13,0:19:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便是他克拉苏 也没有能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even he has resource enough to find so many{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,到国外找到那么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}scattered across foreign soil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.33,0:19:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that we have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.35,0:19:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我们失去的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that has been lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们就这样跑了 将会变得毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will stand for nothing, if we now turn and flee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们留下 克拉苏还会打过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we stay, Crassus will again be upon us and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打败过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have bested them before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们还能再赢一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}And perhaps we may again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.01,0:19:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是代价呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at what cost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之中又会死多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many more among us will fall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少不会舞刀弄剑的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many woman, unable to raise arms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少呱呱坠地的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or children, new to this world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.11,0:19:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让他们得到自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have them free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离共和国渐逼渐近的阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absent darkening shadow of the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就刺穿它的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then let us pierce its heart, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.68,0:19:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那阴影永远消散\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see shadow forever lifted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.61,0:19:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏的军队会从南方压过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus' army pushes from the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是向西进军 我们能在他的军团回防之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we were to turn west we would be at the gates of Rome{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.91,0:19:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,先人一步攻打罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}before his legions could turn to defend the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.65,0:19:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想直接攻打罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would strike at Rome itself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要它瑟瑟发抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would see it tremble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如当年巴蒂塔斯家灭亡时\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the man you once were thundered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所做的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Batiatus fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.14,0:20:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先下去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.77,0:20:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我所说的更有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that I hold higher ground on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.20,0:20:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少罗马人倒在我们的剑下\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many Romans have we seen to the afterlife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.45,0:20:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,共和国听到斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Republic quakes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.52,0:20:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,及其奴隶大军时 就吓得发抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the name of Spartacus and his army of slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.43,0:20:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不过是触动了冰山一角\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have but nipped at the ankle of the beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可要推翻整座大山 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To bare teeth at its throat, I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.44,0:20:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今我害怕它的报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}I now fear the reprisal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.56,0:20:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 携雨之使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bringer of Rain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠影之英雄 居然会害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Slayer of the Shadow of Death? Afraid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无所谓害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for myself, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.66,0:20:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要考虑的远远不止我个人的安危\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my concerns have grown far beyond such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.51,0:20:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我厌倦了避而不战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grow tired of running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.33,0:20:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就歇息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,去陪伴妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Naevia at your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.18,0:20:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她不想背离我们的大业\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she does not want to turn from cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们摧毁了罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until Rome falls beneath our feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.17,0:20:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是要我们走向死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would have us march to our end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是要大家得到自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have us free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truly free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.52,0:21:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为登上了山顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really believe that Crassus will stop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.39,0:21:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏就会停止追捕你们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}once you crest the mountains?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.22,0:21:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,共和国就让我们这样悄悄地溜走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the Republic will let us quietly slip away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.44,0:21:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让他们见识到了自身的脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have shown them vulnerable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让他们见识到哪怕是颤抖的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have shown them that a trembling hand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.03,0:21:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以捏成拳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}can become a fist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.33,0:21:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么奴隶必须明白自己的地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have challenged the idea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么必须学会接受主人的棍棒和鞭打\N{\fnArial\fs30}that a slave must always know his place, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.67,0:21:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们彻底改变了这一无耻的观念\N{\fnArial\fs30}accepting rod and lash because he was taught to accept it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.97,0:21:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们强大的共和国是我们建立的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We built their mighty Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.03,0:21:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们用双手 用鲜血还有生命建立的\N{\fnArial\fs30}With our hands and our blood and our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次 我们必能让它倒下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can see it fall, at equal cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.10,0:21:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你让我睁眼看清一切 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You opened my eyes to this, Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.15,0:21:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让我闭上眼睛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not ask me now to close them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.06,0:21:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,从前多么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was simpler between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.17,0:21:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有同仇敌忾\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the bond stood only as hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.27,0:22:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些日子都过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those days are sadly past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.15,0:22:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管有没有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}With or without you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.67,0:22:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都要向罗马进军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall march upon Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.86,0:22:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,带领同样渴望复仇的人得偿所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}With those who share desire for vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.13,0:22:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为之奋斗的正是自由选择的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have fought for the choice to forge our own path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.11,0:22:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再挡在你的面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will no longer stand in the way of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.29,0:22:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就破晓之时吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the break of dawn then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.95,0:22:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分道扬镳\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall at last part ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.66,0:22:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要请求你最后一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one final thing I would ask of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.36,0:24:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谷地是我们的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The valley is taken!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.32,0:24:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们分享胜利的果实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us share in the spoils of war!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.11,0:24:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,并为克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hold feast for Crixus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.84,0:24:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及跟随不败战神的人饯行\N{\fnArial\fs30}and those who follow the Undefeated Gaul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.26,0:24:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天公发狂 血雨疯降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood rains down from an angry sky, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.05,0:24:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,老屌怒胀 老屌怒胀\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cock rages on! My cock rages on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.57,0:24:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天公发狂 血雨疯降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood rains down from an angry sky, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.48,0:24:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,老屌怒胀 老屌怒胀\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cock rages on! My cock rages on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.94,0:24:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,天公发狂 血雨疯降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood rains down from an angry sky, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.92,0:24:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,老屌怒胀 老屌怒胀\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cock rages on! My cock rages on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.04,0:24:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这酒真辣喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It burns throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.03,0:24:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好酒都是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As does all proper drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.64,0:24:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你该喝水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you should hold with water{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.20,0:24:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱了心神\N{\fnArial\fs30}and more purer thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.11,0:25:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你该再拿一杯来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or perhaps you should get another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.27,0:25:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这杯要喝完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's gone empty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.24,0:25:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上起来脑袋疼可别怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recall when head pounds upon morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.46,0:25:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是遵命行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I but follow command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.00,0:25:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在跟那小东西在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are with little thing, now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.31,0:25:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.09,0:25:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意要伤你的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not wish to see heart wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.05,0:25:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的烈酒还有为人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will ruin little thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.17,0:25:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早会毁了那个小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}with drink and ways of your kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.40,0:25:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,到头你还会到我床上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you again will find my bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.41,0:26:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一起喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not share in drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.90,0:26:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要保持头脑清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have clear head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.54,0:26:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到天亮 克雷斯就要攻打罗马了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When sun breaks, and Crixus strikes for Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.74,0:26:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和高卢人不太合得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have often been at cross purpose with the Gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.65,0:26:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他走了 我还是会想他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet his fucking presence shall be missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.00,0:26:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就体会不到这种痛苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall not feel the sting of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.23,0:26:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是很讨厌他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You yet hate the man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.07,0:26:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用想念他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not miss his presence…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.50,0:26:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不会离开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I shall not be from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.56,0:26:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要离开斯巴达克斯 跟克雷斯走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turn from Spartacus to march with Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.05,0:26:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯如同我的兄长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus stands as a brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.29,0:26:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜这次我们想法不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet in this we are not of like mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.36,0:26:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔卑斯山那边的生活不适合我\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no life for me beyond the Alps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.34,0:27:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我既不会放羊 也不会耕地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am no shepherd nor tiller of land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.62,0:27:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只知道流血打仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood and battle are all I have ever known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.51,0:27:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is settled then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.63,0:27:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我们跟克雷斯同去罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow we move for Rome with Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.68,0:27:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你这么说我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}To hear such words lifts spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.41,0:27:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要你和斯巴达克斯一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I would have you take with Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.02,0:27:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要永远在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}My place is forever with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.98,0:27:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.05,0:27:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经对天发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You once swore the gods themselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.48,0:27:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会抛下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}could not wrest me from your arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.96,0:27:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就他妈的想把我甩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you fucking cast me aside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.87,0:27:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心只为你一人跳动\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart will never beat for another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.55,0:27:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我害死了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet it would seize within chest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.97,0:27:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心也就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I were to drag you to your doom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.66,0:27:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.88,0:27:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}One I am most proud of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.99,0:27:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽力辅佐斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set skills to aiding Spartacus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.35,0:28:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,带领他们获得真正的自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see those less able to true freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.95,0:28:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not ask me to turn from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.49,0:28:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要你活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask only that you live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.90,0:28:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快乐乐地度过余生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wrest what joy that yet may be found in the remaining days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.75,0:28:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.67,0:28:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would break words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.53,0:28:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是劝他改主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will fall upon hardest stone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.14,0:28:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还是死心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they seek to alter mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.95,0:28:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是想和高卢英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would seek to share drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.24,0:28:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,更尽一杯酒罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a man most worthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.44,0:28:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很少这么多愁善感啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sentiment not always held.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.27,0:28:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor always deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.08,0:28:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}By either of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.48,0:28:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候他们都认为我冷酷无情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been known to be contrary, upon occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.26,0:28:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我胜过你的诸多优点之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}A talent among many that I best you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.94,0:28:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没有杀了对方 真是奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a wonder. We have not yet killed each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.86,0:29:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望回到过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that we could reverse the years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.68,0:29:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变我们的处境\N{\fnArial\fs30}towards better footing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.20,0:29:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不出有什么差别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not see it different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.14,0:29:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完成了不可能之事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have done the impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.27,0:29:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,推翻巴蒂塔斯家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen the House of Batiatus to ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.99,0:29:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,捣毁卡普亚竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laid waste to the arena of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.31,0:29:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,打倒葛雷博以及随后而来的罗马军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defeated Glaber and all of the Roman hordes who followed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.46,0:29:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让死了的心重新跳动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Restored heart torn from chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.56,0:29:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你我所爱之人没被夺走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you and I had taken to loving arms, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.84,0:29:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么命运会指引我们走上平淡的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}fate may have led us on a less glorious path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.74,0:29:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂塔斯曾经警告我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus once warned me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.82,0:29:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,人要顺天意而行\N{\fnArial\fs30}that a man must accept his fate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.63,0:29:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则必为命运所毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}or will be destroyed by it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.49,0:29:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那混账跟谁都这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fucking cunt said that to everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.55,0:29:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你得偿所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray that yours holds all you desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.50,0:29:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿今生我们能够再度聚首\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that one day we can greet each other again in this life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.60,0:30:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,血债血偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.35,0:30:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤口疼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it cause pain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.62,0:30:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤口都是可以痊愈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All wounds heal upon a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.26,0:30:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就怕梅泰勒斯的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though I fear injury delivered to Metellus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.68,0:30:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会腐烂生疮\N{\fnArial\fs30}may never cease to fester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.66,0:30:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅泰勒斯有生之年\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all his remaining days, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.85,0:30:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会害怕马科斯•克拉苏这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metellus will fear the name Marcus Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.36,0:30:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,地位更低的人 更要好好地教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Times those beneath us must be struck severest blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.71,0:30:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,要他们知道天高地厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}To truly grasp how we tower above them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.65,0:30:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远没胆子背叛我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to ensure they never betray us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.61,0:30:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅泰勒斯这回学乖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lesson well learned by Metellus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.55,0:30:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果克芮得到过同样的教训…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps if Kore had been given similar instruction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.48,0:30:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别提她的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not form sound of her name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.85,0:30:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.17,0:30:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她伤您这么深 我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It tears heart to know how deeply she wounded you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.28,0:30:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都给她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave all that I could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.68,0:31:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,全然不顾她奴隶的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treated her as if word of slave held no meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.72,0:31:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么她还是不顾一切地离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would she risk all to fly from loving arms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.91,0:31:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hold myself to blame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.75,0:31:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事怎能怪到你头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did your hands do to cause such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.43,0:31:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is what they did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.37,0:31:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道恺撒不可信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Caesar to be untrustworthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.19,0:31:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我看紧了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had laid closer eye upon him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.27,0:31:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不能带她到山上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would not have been able to see her to the ridge…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.02,0:31:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也就没机会逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and allowed opportunity of escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.23,0:31:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,恺撒行事放荡不羁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar is of wild mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.77,0:31:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不认为他知道她的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I do not believe he knew her thoughts in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.53,0:31:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道权力越大责任越大\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I believe that great power is accompanied{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.27,0:31:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,担子更沉 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}by many burdens, father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.31,0:31:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要分清谁是最值得信赖的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing whom to trust paramount among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.29,0:31:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wisdom well received.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.30,0:32:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are certain of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.72,0:32:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心里左右矛盾了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have for heavy span been pulled in opposing direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.10,0:32:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing I have noted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.48,0:32:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你一直支持我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude for standing by my words, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.94,0:32:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你并不赞同我的观点\N{\fnArial\fs30}even when you did not believe in them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.08,0:32:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信的是你这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believed in the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.85,0:32:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远都信\N{\fnArial\fs30}And always shall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.63,0:32:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力冈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.31,0:32:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你能得到想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you find what you seek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.79,0:32:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经历了这么多艰难困苦 希望你得到慰藉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you some measure of comfort, despite all that has happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.62,0:32:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最应该得到慰藉的人 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one is more deserving of it, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.67,0:33:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,克芮在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Kore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.34,0:33:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡得正香呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrapped in arms of relieved slumber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.92,0:33:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她感到很庆幸 自己还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And filled with gratitude that she yet draws breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.60,0:33:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的功劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kindness moved by your tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.36,0:33:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到你会对一个奴隶这么好心\N{\fnArial\fs30}One I did not expect to make sound towards life of a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.32,0:33:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是女主人时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mistreated none within my house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.88,0:33:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可从不苛待奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I was yet called domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.99,0:33:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你仍将他们视为物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you held them as possessions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.91,0:33:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,随意买卖交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things to be bought and traded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.50,0:33:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏待我也是一样 难道你忘记了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I was by Crassus himself, or have you forgotten…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.92,0:33:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这才多长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have suffered but briefest moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.58,0:33:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人一辈子深陷苦海\N{\fnArial\fs30}of that which so many have only ever known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.24,0:33:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要比比谁的伤痛更深吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You desire to compare wounds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.02,0:33:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就说说看 然后评判一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us weigh them, and judge balance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.23,0:33:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你的伤已经痊愈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wounds must be all but healed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.83,0:33:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,又变成原来那个难缠的女人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You return to difficult woman of old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.41,0:33:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天性难改\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot turn from truest nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.07,0:33:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.59,0:33:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天性难改\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.59,0:33:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去参加宴会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rejoin celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.91,0:33:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早就要长途跋涉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard journey awaits at dawn's break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.55,0:33:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒已经喝够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have had my fill of wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.57,0:33:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要有人陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And company less desired…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.92,0:34:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You yet stand Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.73,0:34:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不能与你交心\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing I can never hold to heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.95,0:34:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我要的不是你的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not your heart I'm after this night…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.20,0:35:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当年那个在竞技场上目瞪口呆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems but yesterday you stood as opened-mouthed Gaul, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.62,0:35:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,急于证明实力的高卢人 仿佛就在昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}anxious to prove yourself in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.18,0:35:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今有数千人自愿追随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now thousands gladly follow you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.63,0:35:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,去攻打罗马了\N{\fnArial\fs30}lay assault upon Rome itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.34,0:35:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你也能加入我们的行列\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would hold it as a blessing from Jupiter himself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.46,0:35:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就真是诸神眷顾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you would join with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.84,0:35:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走的是另一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}My journey leads toward other path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.46,0:35:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让男人放下屠刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no greater cause, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.51,0:35:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,无疑是最伟大的功业\N{\fnArial\fs30}to turn a man from battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.58,0:35:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we stand ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.86,0:36:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你下令 我们就启程去罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upon your command, we move for Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.61,0:36:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍然怀疑你的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}A decision I yet hold in grievous doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.84,0:36:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要是我信仰诸神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet if I believed in the gods, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.61,0:36:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必定虔诚祈求 是我想错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would split heavens in prayer that I was mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.12,0:36:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我要尽我所能 证明你是傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would give my all to prove you yet the fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.50,0:36:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上粮草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoulder supplies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.28,0:36:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们北上阿尔卑斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We move north for the mountains!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.95,0:36:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.06,0:36:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们还是巴蒂塔斯的角斗士时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we were yet of Batiatus' ludus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.40,0:36:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我们有可能成为兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spoke of how we may have been as brothers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.30,0:36:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到下辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}in another life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.26,0:36:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而非今生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet not in this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.30,0:36:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know that I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.89,0:36:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今生我永远当你是兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And will always hold you as such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.49,0:36:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I will hold you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.63,0:37:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯兵分两路了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus divides his forces?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.48,0:37:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部队将北上阿尔卑斯山\N{\fnArial\fs30}The larger sum striking north towards the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.94,0:37:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人和孩子大大拖慢了他们的脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their numbers weighted by women and children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.79,0:37:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The remainder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.55,0:37:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们往哪边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}What course do they take?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.28,0:37:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,西进\N{\fnArial\fs30}West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.88,0:37:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,去罗马吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Towards Rome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.64,0:37:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,您要我们阻截哪一路\N{\fnArial\fs30}What path would you have us follow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.19,0:37:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一条路可行\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is but one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.81,0:37:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须保卫罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city must be defended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.25,0:37:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿路自有人阻截他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others will give resistance upon way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.51,0:37:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞斯的军团在城门外防守\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Arrius and his legion hold position beyond its gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.31,0:37:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,单凭一个军团也只能拦截斯巴达克斯一时\N{\fnArial\fs30}A single legion will give Spartacus briefest pause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.82,0:37:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看情况 领军西进的并非斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus does not command western forces, upon sighting of exodus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.30,0:37:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他的高卢走狗带队\N{\fnArial\fs30}His pet Gaul leads assault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.66,0:37:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.08,0:38:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,此人战力与他相当 而且更加嗜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man of equal skill and deadlier passion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.59,0:38:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟不是该死的携雨之使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the Bringer of Fucking Rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.77,0:38:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能置罗马于不顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot leave Rome undefended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.22,0:38:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞斯可以拖住克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrius will slow Crixus' advance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.25,0:38:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够我们先去打击较弱的斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}granting needed time to set upon Spartacus and weakened numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.37,0:38:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须攻其弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must press advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.41,0:38:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听这孩子的话 罗马就危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow advice of this child, and Rome herself may fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.34,0:38:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马一旦被攻陷 我们就全完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with her everything we have fucking reached for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.27,0:38:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了你这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have had fill of you questioning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.70,0:38:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说什么你反驳什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}every word that falls from my tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.46,0:38:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就少胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then break them with more fucking sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.44,0:38:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能丢下罗马不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot turn from Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.98,0:38:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么行动由我父亲决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall turn in whatever direction my father decides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.66,0:38:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就献上良策\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then aid him in proper choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.68,0:38:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是顺水推舟 溜须拍马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not one you believe he seeks to hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.55,0:38:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的都是我自己的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I follow my own desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.46,0:38:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,强奸克芮也是你自己的想法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you did when you forced yourself upon Kore, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.86,0:38:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在你父亲夺回希留爱沙的那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}the night your father reclaimed Sinuessa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.71,0:38:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告过你 要想人不知除非己莫为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you that your deed would fall to discovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.53,0:38:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了整我 你开始编故事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would fabricate lies now, to see me lessened…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.23,0:38:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别装了 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game is over, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.65,0:39:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个妓女坎莎拉说她看到你从克芮帐篷里出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whore Canthara tells of how she saw you come from Kore's tent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.05,0:39:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现她备受欺凌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of finding her roughly used.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.49,0:39:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被迫答应对当晚看到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was made to promise never to reveal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.28,0:39:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远闭口不谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}what her eyes laid upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.03,0:39:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我这张嘴皮子厉害着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can be very, very persuasive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.03,0:39:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过一个为钱卖身的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You risk all on the tale of a woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.16,0:39:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的故事你也押宝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}who swallows cock for coin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.05,0:39:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去比这更不靠谱的赌注\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have made more uncertain wagers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.11,0:39:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不是没赌过\N{\fnArial\fs30}in years past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.93,0:39:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这不活得好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet here I stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.05,0:39:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么不去跟他告状\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why have you not yet told him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.73,0:39:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,得知心爱的奴隶背叛 他已经承受不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has been pushed to brink of madness by imagined betrayal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.36,0:39:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再拿残酷的事实去刺激他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not see him forced over precipice by truth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.24,0:39:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他不堪重负\N{\fnArial\fs30}of harsher realities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.49,0:39:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你要我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you have of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.82,0:39:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you have already been asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.19,0:39:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲听你的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your father's ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.64,0:39:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他恢复理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him to reason, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.28,0:39:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令你怎么说 你就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}breaking words as I command them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.56,0:40:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不听你的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not take command from you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.69,0:40:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好接受我的提议 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have accepted offer, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.53,0:40:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲差点让你在十一抽杀中丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father nearly saw you to end in decimation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.23,0:40:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他得知了你的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps he shall see fate to completion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.13,0:40:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就不会手下留情…\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he hears what you have done{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.21,0:40:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seize him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.48,0:40:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.06,0:40:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不许你对我出手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shall never lay hands upon me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.60,0:40:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许再鬼话连篇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor whisper lies against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.60,0:40:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot take my life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.77,0:40:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没办法偷偷摸摸弄走我的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see my body from encampment absent notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.24,0:40:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,老子可是盖乌斯•恺撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Julius Fucking Caesar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.61,0:40:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他按住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold him against table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.32,0:40:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟梅泰勒斯一个德行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are of same cloth as Metellus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.70,0:40:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,非要好好教训你一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}And must be taught severest lesson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.97,0:40:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,才知道天高地厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}in who towers above you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.15,0:41:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胆敢泄漏一个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak of what you know to anyone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.03,0:41:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要众人皆知 伟大的恺撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I shall spin tale of the mighty Caesar…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.83,0:41:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟娘们一样被爆菊\N{\fnArial\fs30}taken like a woman…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.66,0:41:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天属于我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day is ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.18,0:41:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪天不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}When is it fucking not?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.71,0:41:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备进军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to march.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.67,0:42:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一仗便大功告成\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one battle yet remaining.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.64,0:42:06.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗马）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.01,0:42:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马 终于近在咫尺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome at last lies within our grasp!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.71,0:42:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们前方只有蠢货艾瑞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last legion led by the fool Arrius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.50,0:42:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及他率领的军团了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is all that stands between us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.56,0:42:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的胜利将成为传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a victory that shall become legend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.51,0:42:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前 当我还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lifetime ago when I yet stood beneath the roof{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.58,0:42:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂塔斯家的奴隶时\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the House of Batiatus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.49,0:42:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的教练奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}my doctore Oenomaus demanded answer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.95,0:42:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,问那些打算在竞技场上\N{\fnArial\fs30}from those recruits who sought glory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.67,0:43:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,追求荣誉的新人\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon the sands of the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.98,0:43:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们脚下是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What lies beneath your feet?!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.66,0:43:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是圣地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sacred ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.29,0:43:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,浸满了血泪的土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watered with tears of blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.47,0:43:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.36,0:43:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到罗马人的血泪浸染大地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it shall be Rome who sheds them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.26,0:43:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以开始了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we begin?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.69,0:43:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以开始了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we begin?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.21,0:43:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以开始了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we begin?!!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.11,0:43:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,火球准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring fire forth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.63,0:43:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.72,0:44:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shields!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.13,0:44:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起盾牌防御\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise your fucking shields!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.03,0:45:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,后方没有什么危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rear position stands absent threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.37,0:45:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿一直如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray it remains so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.17,0:45:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,少了克雷斯和跟他走的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our numbers stand ill match absent Crixus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.97,0:45:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是克拉苏打过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and those who follow him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.77,0:45:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完全不是对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Crassus were to set upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.90,0:46:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞斯败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrius has fallen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.58,0:46:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是天神下凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand as a fucking god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.81,0:46:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马因你而颤抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Rome trembling before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.82,0:46:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如斯巴达克斯发过的誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}As Spartacus once promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.98,0:46:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.45,0:46:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,全军待命 统帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men stand ready, Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.17,0:46:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,恺撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.13,0:46:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天怎么沦落至此\N{\fnArial\fs30}How have you come to be so rudely handled?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.90,0:46:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我与人争执 有失体面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found myself in shameful altercation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.95,0:46:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不能这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shall not happen again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.79,0:47:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不骑马\N{\fnArial\fs30}And reason you not astride horse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.83,0:47:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令他徒步冲锋 统帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave command for him to lead charge upon foot, Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.74,0:47:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样更能激励普通士兵的士气\N{\fnArial\fs30}To rally the common men that hold him in such high regard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.31,0:47:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us see this to proper end, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.21,0:47:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,再去追击斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and return to pursuit of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.55,0:47:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们人多势众\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will attempt to overrun position!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.39,0:47:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让他们自以为是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them think they have succeeded, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.20,0:47:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从两翼包抄击败他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fall upon them from our flanks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.27,0:47:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不败的高卢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the undefeated Gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.24,0:47:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们知道这个名号实至名归\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us show them how such name was earned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.83,0:47:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,吹号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound horns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.60,0:47:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿好长矛和利剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring spear and sword to bear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.32,0:47:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀他个片甲不留\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fall upon them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.61,0:47:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,要这帮杂碎统统归西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send them to the fucking afterlife!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.96,0:48:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.26,0:48:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退 撤回高地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back and re-form upon higher advantage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.21,0:48:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝老子的厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink my fucking piss, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.60,0:48:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you Roman cunts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.17,0:49:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,恺撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.07,0:49:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌方东翼已溃败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their eastern flank has been broken!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.68,0:49:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.74,0:49:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们人数太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are too many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.40,0:49:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果克拉苏死了 我们还是能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Crassus falls, we may yet seize fucking day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.63,0:50:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.99,0:50:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.50,0:50:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你这么容易就死了 盖乌斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not have you so easily leave from this world, Gaius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.52,0:50:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.53,0:50:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那个婊子闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silence that fucking bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.66,0:50:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.39,0:50:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是想打垮罗马的高卢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Gaul that would seek the fall of Rome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.58,0:51:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他的臭婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his fucking woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.71,0:51:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,败在我手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defeated by my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.95,0:51:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿回你的剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retrieve your sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.72,0:51:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就该回到主人手里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been too long from proper hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.07,0:51:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man yet lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.22,0:51:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要钉死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall see him crucified{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.23,0:51:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.51,0:51:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要借此机会给斯巴达克斯送个信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would use opportunity to send message to Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.51,0:51:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他知道败得有多惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that he may know the depths of his failure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.16,0:51:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他注定只能是这样的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what fate I shall see him to as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.21,0:51:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍下他的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take his head.{\r}
